{"t":"Forsaken Mine","s":"forsaken-mine-0332e","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/ForsakenMineEntrance_90d7d5.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"ForsakenMineEntrance\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/ForsakenMineEntrance_90d7d5.png\" width=\"450\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Forsaken Mine</b> is located south of the gate to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32648,31732,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32648, 31732, 7)</a>, and can change daily to contain different creatures.\n</p><p>Known cave versions are:\n</p>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"#/wiki/Forsaken%20Mine%2FRorcs\">Forsaken Mine/Rorcs</a></b>\n<ul><li>containing <a href=\"#/wiki/Rorc\">Rorcs</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li><b><a href=\"#/wiki/Forsaken%20Mine%2FForest%20Furies\">Forsaken Mine/Forest Furies</a></b>\n<ul><li>containing <a href=\"#/wiki/Forest%20Fury\">Forest Furies</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Leaf%20Golem\">Leaf Golems</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Wilting%20Leaf%20Golem\">Wilting Leaf Golems</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li><b><a href=\"#/wiki/Forsaken%20Mine%2FCyclopes\">Forsaken Mine/Cyclopes</a></b>\n<ul><li>containing <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclopes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Drone\">Cyclops Drones</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Smith\">Cyclops Smiths</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li><b><a href=\"#/wiki/Forsaken%20Mine%2FLost%20Dwarves\">Forsaken Mine/Lost Dwarves</a></b>\n<ul><li>containing <a href=\"#/wiki/Drillworm\">Drillworms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Husher\">Lost Hushers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Thrower\">Lost Throwers</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Basher\">Lost Bashers</a>.</li></ul></li></ul></div>","quests":[]}